[
  {
    "content_id": "10056001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我保羅作上帝的奴僕和耶穌基督的使徒，是為了使上帝揀選的人有信心並明白真理，從而過敬虔的生活，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;有永生的盼望。這永生是從不說謊的上帝在亙古以前應許的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;祂在所定的時候，藉著人的傳揚將自己的道顯明出來。我奉我們救主上帝的命令傳揚這道。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;提多啊，我寫信給你，就我們共同的信仰來說，你是我真正的兒子。 願父上帝和我們的救主基督耶穌賜給你恩典和平安！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;當初，我把你留在克里特島，是要你完成未辦完的事工，並照我的指示在各城選立長老。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;作長老的必須無可指責，只有一位妻子，兒女都信主、沒有放蕩不羈的行為。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;身為上帝的管家，作監督的必須無可指責，不傲慢，不暴躁，不酗酒，不好鬥，不貪財。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;他必須好客、樂善、自制、正直、聖潔、自律，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;持守所領受的真道，以便能夠以純正的教導勸勉人，駁倒那些反對的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;因為有許多悖逆之人喜歡空談，善於欺騙，尤其是那些奉行割禮的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;你一定要堵住他們的口，因為他們為了不義之財教不該教的，毀壞別人全家。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;克里特人自己的一位先知說：「克里特人說謊成性，邪惡如獸，好吃懶做。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;這話是真的。因此你要嚴正地斥責他們，使他們有純正的信仰，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;不理會猶太人的無稽之談和那些違背真理之人的誡律。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;對潔淨的人而言，一切都是潔淨的；對污穢不信的人而言，什麼都不潔淨，連他們的思想和良心都是污穢的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56001016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;他們自稱認識上帝，在行為上卻否認祂。他們令人可憎，悖逆成性，一無是處。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;你的教導要符合純正的教義。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;勸年長的男子要節制、莊重、自律，有全備的信心、愛心和耐心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;勸年長的婦女要過敬虔的生活，不說長道短，不做酒的奴隸，要以身作則。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;這樣，她們就能教導年輕的婦女愛丈夫、愛兒女、</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;自制、貞潔、持家、和善、順服丈夫，免得上帝的道被人毀謗。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;勸勉年輕的男子要自制。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;你自己要在各樣善行上作眾人的榜樣，在教導上要誠懇、認真、</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;言語純全、無可指責，讓那些反對的人無話可說、自覺羞愧。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;勸勉作奴僕的要凡事順服主人，讓主人滿意，不頂撞主人，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;不偷拿主人的東西，為人要忠信可靠，好凡事尊崇我們救主上帝的教導。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;因為上帝拯救世人的恩典已經顯明了，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;這恩典教導我們除掉不敬虔的心和世俗的私慾，在今世過自律、公義、敬畏上帝的生活，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;懷著美好的盼望等候我們偉大的上帝和救主耶穌基督的榮耀顯現。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;主耶穌為我們犧牲自己，要救贖我們脫離一切罪惡，並潔淨我們，使我們作祂熱心行善的子民。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56002015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;你要講明這些事，充分運用權柄來勸勉人、責備人，別讓人輕看你。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;你要提醒眾人順服執政掌權者，要服從，隨時準備做各種善事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;不要毀謗，不要爭吵，要謙和、恭敬地對待每一個人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;從前我們也愚蠢、悖逆、易受迷惑，受各種私慾和享樂驅使，心裡充滿惡念和嫉妒，令人憎惡，也彼此憎恨。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;但我們的救主上帝向人彰顯了祂的恩慈和仁愛，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;藉著重生之洗和聖靈的更新拯救了我們，這並非因為我們有義行，而是因為祂的憐憫。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;上帝藉著我們的救主耶穌基督把聖靈豐豐富富地澆灌在我們身上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;這樣，我們既然靠著祂的恩典被稱為義人，就可以成為後嗣，有永生的盼望。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;以上這些話是可信的，希望你認真強調，使信上帝的人專心行善。這都是造福眾人的美事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;要避免愚昧的爭論、有關家譜的辯駁和律法上的爭執，因為這些毫無益處。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;對於製造分裂的人，警告過一兩次後，要和他斷絕來往。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;因為你知道這種人已經背道犯罪，自定己罪。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我會派亞提馬或者推基古去見你。到時候，你要盡快到尼哥波立來見我，因為我決定在那裡過冬。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你要為西納律師和亞波羅送行，盡力幫助他們，讓他們路上一無所缺。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;我們的弟兄姊妹也要學習行善，供應有急需的人，免得毫無建樹。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10056003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提多書 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "56003015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;這裡的弟兄姊妹都問候你，也請你問候那些因信仰而愛我們的人。 願恩典常與你們眾人同在！</p>"
  }
]